sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	participant Commerce as Commerce
	participant Gateway as API Gateway
	participant Ordering as Ordering API
	participant Basket as Basket API
	participant Catalog as Catalog API
	participant Finance as Finance
	participant Notification as Notification

	Commerce ->> Gateway: Synchronous checkout request
	Gateway ->> Ordering: Synchronous validated request
	Ordering ->> Basket: Synchronous basket read
	Basket -->> Ordering: Current quantities
	Ordering ->> Catalog: Synchronous catalog and price read
	Catalog -->> Ordering: Authoritative book data

	alt Duplicate request or basket/catalog read failure
		Ordering -->> Commerce: Return prior order or reject without commit
	else New request and reads succeed
		Ordering ->> Ordering: Commit order and purchase-time snapshot
		Ordering -->> Commerce: Synchronous order identifier
		Ordering -->> Finance: Asynchronous checkout fact
	end

	Finance ->> Finance: Start order workflow

	par Independent downstream work
		Finance -->> Basket: Asynchronous basket cleanup command
		Finance -->> Notification: Asynchronous email command
	end

	alt Basket cleanup succeeds
		Basket ->> Basket: Delete basket
		Basket -->> Finance: Cleanup succeeded
	else Basket cleanup fails or times out
		Basket -->> Finance: Cleanup failed
		Finance ->> Finance: Retry bounded cleanup attempts

		opt Retry limit exhausted
			Finance -->> Notification: Compensation email command
		end
	end

	Notification ->> Notification: Apply idempotency and send email
